  "new_commit_message": "feat(browse-local-sentry): Add skill for QA in a local Sentry dev server (#182)\n\nAdds a skill that attaches an agent's browser to the user's own\nsigned-in Chrome, with a trusted mkcert certificate, so it can QA and\nscreenshot a local Sentry dev server. Without it, agents launch a\nthrowaway browser, hit the self-signed certificate or a login wall, and\nreport that browser verification was blocked.",
